HANDOFF_DESIGN_UI.md is the state-of-play note for the design/UI-UX
workstream: where the code is, what exists, what is missing, which frozen
constraints govern, and the open questions. It sits with the STAGE*_NOTES
files because it is the same kind of document — what a reader needs before
touching this repository, rather than a record of one stage.

`Claude outputs/` is Cowork's output directory on a developer's machine. It
mirrors files that already live here, so tracking it would store each of them
twice. `scripts/check-secrets.mjs` already refuses it as a tracked path; this
keeps it out of `git status` as well.

`design-prototypes/` stays deliberately untracked. Where it belongs depends on
an open decision — the landing in its own repository or in this monorepo — and
`APPLYING-TO-PRODUCT.md § 6` answers that for the landing itself: its own
repository. Committing 1.4MB of brand assets here before that is settled would
mean moving them out of the history later.

